title:        README gallery: Export mode on the demo project
author:       salim-slimani
source:       original work (screenshot of the FilmSweet demo project, captured with the app's ui.screenshot control command)
license:      MIT OR Apache-2.0
license-file:
added:        2026-10-17 by salim-slimani (agent)
notes:        Export mode: the Destinations panel, the Media File settings (H.264, Match Source - Adaptive High Bitrate, VBR 1 pass, AAC 320 kbps) with the Video and Audio sections, and the Summary readout; the preview shows the graded dunes frame. 1600x900. Every frame shown is FilmSweet's own procedurally generated demo media (crates/media/src/generators.rs); contains no third-party, Adobe or copyrighted footage. All UI icons are drawn in code; fonts are Inter and JetBrains Mono (OFL-1.1).
